    "name": "Tale of Darkness",
    "steam_appid": 3551300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/94af6faa584bd46d1387bc3e72652569.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/5ce86b9d7aa16ddbe25b9a5812235b24.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/5ce86b9d7aa16ddbe25b9a5812235b24.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the once flourishing Kingdom of Malvora, now a twisted decrepit shadow of itself teeming with its corrupted former inhabitants, deadly traps and punishing curses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/c5ac191f56eef5d400681e510c189f91.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/6e990db15dfae9a062b4a02a49c5e9b3.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/6e990db15dfae9a062b4a02a49c5e9b3.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether deciding to focus on speed, strength, magic or a combination of your choosing, Malvora\u2019s challenges are many but so are the methods of overcoming them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/d39fe6cbc650e3c3d7675eab3b265fa9.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/1180ed9b0907e8a240d3958e43723f8c.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/1180ed9b0907e8a240d3958e43723f8c.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take vengeance on your former allies who have betrayed and left you for dead. With each of the betrayers having different strengths and weaknesses the path to retake the throne is all but simple.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/dc9f12fedf084e7ab05eda61987eff19.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/74c3ec9c3e61bf7273757511bc5c76e9.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/74c3ec9c3e61bf7273757511bc5c76e9.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save characters that will help you on your journey and unlock items that will be key to traversing the harsh road to the throne. But each game presents a possibility of those characters being taken away or the precious items stolen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/4df56a7c8bc4ed9e68fb440a744333e1.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/cf09f4e5654b9d265b9015111b5fd717.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/cf09f4e5654b9d265b9015111b5fd717.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The Oblivion continually twists and mutates the realm, making each run different from the last. In an unpredictable world taking back the throne can be achieved only through skill and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/2e417be0e22e93155f0266763f981211.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/94af6faa584bd46d1387bc3e72652569.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/5ce86b9d7aa16ddbe25b9a5812235b24.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/5ce86b9d7aa16ddbe25b9a5812235b24.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the once flourishing Kingdom of Malvora, now a twisted decrepit shadow of itself teeming with its corrupted former inhabitants, deadly traps and punishing curses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/c5ac191f56eef5d400681e510c189f91.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/6e990db15dfae9a062b4a02a49c5e9b3.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/6e990db15dfae9a062b4a02a49c5e9b3.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether deciding to focus on speed, strength, magic or a combination of your choosing, Malvora\u2019s challenges are many but so are the methods of overcoming them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/d39fe6cbc650e3c3d7675eab3b265fa9.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/1180ed9b0907e8a240d3958e43723f8c.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/1180ed9b0907e8a240d3958e43723f8c.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take vengeance on your former allies who have betrayed and left you for dead. With each of the betrayers having different strengths and weaknesses the path to retake the throne is all but simple.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/dc9f12fedf084e7ab05eda61987eff19.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/74c3ec9c3e61bf7273757511bc5c76e9.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/74c3ec9c3e61bf7273757511bc5c76e9.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save characters that will help you on your journey and unlock items that will be key to traversing the harsh road to the throne. But each game presents a possibility of those characters being taken away or the precious items stolen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/4df56a7c8bc4ed9e68fb440a744333e1.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/cf09f4e5654b9d265b9015111b5fd717.poster.avif?t=1753253046\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/cf09f4e5654b9d265b9015111b5fd717.webm?t=1753253046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The Oblivion continually twists and mutates the realm, making each run different from the last. In an unpredictable world taking back the throne can be achieved only through skill and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551300/extras/2e417be0e22e93155f0266763f981211.avif?t=1753253046\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Tale of Darkness is a brutal, action roguelite. Play as the Betrayed King, ascend from the grave, fight your way through hordes of twisted enemies, defeat your betrayers and free the realm of the Oblivion. Then die and do it all over again.",
